Dynamic Routing

!@EIGRP -C1
conf t
 router eigrp 100
  no auto-summary
  eigrp router-id 192.168.1.129
  network 10.2.1.0 0.0.0.255
  network 10.2.2.0 0.0.0.255
  network 192.168.1.128 0.0.0.31
  network 10.1.4.4 0.0.0.3
  end


  !@OSPF -C1
conf t
 router ospf 1
  router-id 192.168.1.129
  network 10.2.1.0 0.0.0.255 area 0
  network 10.2.2.0 0.0.0.255 area 0
  network 192.168.1.128 0.0.0.31 area 0
  network 10.1.4.4 0.0.0.3 area 0
  end

!@BGP - C1
conf t
 router bgp 1
  bgp log-neighbor-changes
  neighbor 10.1.4.5 remote-as 4
  address-family ipv4
   neighbor 10.1.4.5 activate
   network 192.168.1.128 mask 255.255.255.224
   network 10.2.1.0 mask 255.255.255.0
   network 10.2.2.0 mask 255.255.255.0
   network 10.1.4.4 mask 255.255.255.252
  exit-address-family
end



### EIGRP
 - distance vector
 - dual algorithim

EIGRP Message
1. Hello - Used to discover and maintain neighbor relationships/sessions
2. Query - Used to request routing information from neighbors / When a route is lost EIGRP[ routers send Query messages
3. Update - New ROUTE ADVERT


