### EIGP Metric computation

1. Bandwidth/ THROUGHPUT
= 10^7 / Get only the Minimum BW of the interface 

2. Total Delay / LATENCY
= total DLY OF ALL THE INTERFACE / 10

3. COMPOSITE METRIC
= 256 * (THROUGHPUT + LATENCY)


