  ### wide metric

  given values
  min = 10 000
  total delay = 1010
  
  1. throiupuit
  = 10^7 * 65536 / min bw
  = 655 360 000 000 / 10 000
  65 536 000


  2. latency
  = total delay psec (6 na 0) * 65536 / 10^6
  = 1 010 000 000 * 65536 / 1 000 000



  3. composite metric
  = througput + latency

  4. final metric
  composite metric / RIB SCALE



  ####
  MIN DELAY = 10 000
  TOTAL DELAY = (10 000 + 1 000 + 10) = 11 010

  1. throughput
  = 10^7 * 65536 / MIN DELAY
  = 10^7 * 65536 / 10 000
  = 65 536 000

  2. latency
  = TOTAL DELAY * 65536 / 10^6
  = 11 010 000 000 * 65536 / 1 000 000
  = 721 551 360 000 000 / 1 000 000
  = 721 551 360

 3. composite metric
  = throughput + latency
 = 65 536 000 + 721 551 360
 = 787 087 360

 4. ribscale
composite metric / RIB SCALE
 = 787 087 360 / 128
 = 6 149 120




