### 🎯 Excercise 13: Summarize routes from loopback 33 - loopback 36
- 10.10.33.0   /25
- 10.10.33.128 /25
- 10.10.34.0   /25
- 10.10.34.128 /25

o: 3rd
r: 33-34.255
i:
2i: 32

10.10.32.0 /22

!@R2
conf t
router ospf 1
area 26 range 10.10.32.0 255.255.252.0
end


!@R2:
conf t
ip prefix-list NOLOOP seq 10 deny 10.10.8.0/22 ge 24
ip prefix-list NOLOOP seq 20 deny 10.10.32.0/22 ge 25
ip prefix-list NOLOOP seq 30 permit 0.0.0.0/0 le 32

router ospf 1
 area 0 filter-list prefix NOLOOP in
 end


